  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egypt Sustainable POPs Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to improve the management and disposal of targeted stockpiles of obsolete pesticides, including Persistent Organic Pollutants (POPs) and Polychlorinated Biphenyl (PCBs), in an environmentally sound manner.</narrative>
  </description>
